  "description": "Long Term Investment In A Different Part of The World 🌱 When we invested in China back in January 2025, BABA ran +80%. Now, a different region is also doing the unexpected...",
  "body_html": "<p>Everyone chants “Apple!” “Tesla!” “Nvidia!”…with out a second thought because these are popular. One glance at the chart…and popular is NOT working… Look where others are not! </p><p>How many people were also bellowing that China was going to collapse? Yea, I loved herd behavior rhetoric, it was one of the key signals to keep Chinese stocks on the radar. And eventually, <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/chinas-economy-making-moves?r=4z8lgl\">we entered positions</a>.  From January 20th, Alibaba <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$BABA&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> ran over 80%. No, we did not catch all of that trend and exited before earnings…but it was a very profitable trade for 2025.  </p><p>With Tariffs across the board, the same herd is chanting doom for the rest of the world…thinking they are solely reliant off the United States. Forgetting that many of these countries have independent economic ecosystems that will thrive regardless. And there is an ETF that provides us access to those opportunities.</p><p>The region I think a great investment is…</p>",
